  "_comment": [
    "Amendments to the published spreadsheet. The institute changes schedules",
    "after publishing and never reissues the file, so corrections live here and",
    "are reapplied on every rebuild.",
    "",
    "Ops: move / add / remove / credits / set_dates / add_course.",
    "Target a course by \"name\" (durable) rather than \"code\" (derived).",
    "Everything is declarative and idempotent: running the build twice is a no-op,",
    "and an override that no longer matches the sheet fails loudly."
